From 48592a0adcc53b0f03cad20e33e40941635f76a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "MR. ARX" <dev@nexeris.dev>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 19:23:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign admin panel to match reference: icon sidebar + real
 Overview dashboard
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- AdminSidebar: new component, icon + pill-active-state nav matching
  the reference (was plain uppercase text links).
- Admin Overview rebuilt with real data throughout:
  - Stat cards (Users/Boards/Classes/E-Books) with real totals AND
    real 'this week' deltas (created_at >= now - 7d).
  - Recent Activity pulled from audit_logs (USER_ADDED, BOARD_CREATED,
    ADMIN_ACTION video/ebook created, role changes, etc, mapped to
    friendly labels+icons) — noisy event types (logins, per-student
    video access) are filtered out.
  - Recently Added Users table (real authorized_users rows).
  - Quick Actions linking to the existing admin creation flows.
  - A real 7-day chart (new LineChart component, pure SVG, no chart
    library) of signups + content published. The reference's 'Page
    Views' line is NOT included — there's no page-view analytics
    tracked anywhere in this app, and fabricating that data would just
    be lying to whoever reads this dashboard. Chart is honestly
    relabeled 'Platform Activity' with a note explaining the swap.
